| Group detail | Send / Request / Settings | `/groups/[id]/send`, `/groups/[id]/request`, `/groups/[id]/settings` | ✅ |
| Group Send/Request success | Back to group | `router.replace({ pathname: '/groups/[id]', params: { id } })` | ✅ |

