Example `en.json`: `{ "welcome": "Welcome to Buffr", "phone_entry": "Enter your phone number", "verify_otp": "Verify code", "send": "Send", "redeem": "Redeem", "cash_out": "Cash out" }`. Add `kj.json` (Oshiwambo) and `af.json` (Afrikaans).

