### Template 2: Hub + Selection Flow (2-3 Steps)

**Use for:** Cash-Out Methods, Voucher Redemption, Payment Method Selection

```typescript
// Step 1: Hub Screen (Method Selection)
// screens/hub/index.tsx
export default function HubScreen() {
  const methods = [
